# Summary

Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter. [[cite:obs-f8ee468dc10f0d624f48c3709d41ec12f05787e6 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

The ordinary contribution is one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January. [[cite:obs-11e5c01d822f202a108f9ae35f3ccd19bc5a3c65 "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]